// One Oclock Jump

Tempo 140
Keysig D

Groove BigBandIntro
Begin Solo
    Voice JazzGuitar
    Volume ff
    Articulate 50
    Harmony OpenBelow+Open8Below
    Octave 6
    Begin Riff
        8r;4a;8g;2a;
        8r;4a;8g;2a;
        8a;g;a;g;a;g;a;g;
        2.a;
    End
End

Cresc mp mf 4
Swingmode On  // only effects the solo
1         D
2         /
3        A7
4         /


Repeat  /// this is for the whole song
Repeat
Groove BigBand
Volume m

5         D
6         /
7        /     /     A7
8         D

Groove BigBandPlus
Cresc mf 4

9        G7
10        /
11        D      /     A7
12        D

Groove BigBand
Decresc m 2

13       A7
14        /

Groove BigBandPlus

15        D      /     A7
16        D

RepeatEnd

Groove BigBandSus
Volume mf

17        /
18        /
19        /
20        /

Groove BigBandSusPlus
Volume f

21       G7
22        /
23        D
24        /

Groove BigBandSus
Volume m

25       G7
26        /

RepeatEnding
Decresc mp 2

27        D

Groove BigBandFill

28      Fm7     A7      D

RepeatEnd
Groove BigBandEnd
Decresc pp 2

29        D
30      Fm7     A7      D
